DYNAMIC ROUTES

/products    - basic route 

    list of products
    - product 1
    - product 2
    - product 3 ...

/products/id - detailed page

/products/1  - product 1 detailed page
/products/2  - product 2 detailed page 
/products/3  - product 3 detailed page 




app/
├── products/
│   ├── page.tsx
│   └── [id]/
│       └── page.tsx



/products/[id]
       ↑
    dynamic


/products/25
         ↑
      id = 25


/products/25
       │
       ↓
     [id]
       │
       ↓
    params
       │
       ↓
{ id: "25" }



The current Next.js API provides params as a Promise:

params
   ↓
Promise
   ↓ await
